      "@id": "kt:prompt-sensitivity",
      "@type": "kto:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "Prompt sensitivity",
      "skos:definition": "The tendency of language models to give substantially different outputs and accuracy when a prompt is changed in ways that should not matter, such as its formatting, instruction wording, choice of demonstrations, or the order of those demonstrations.",
