      "@type": "kto:Technique",
      "skos:prefLabel": "Knowledge distillation",
      "skos:definition": "A training technique in which a smaller \"student\" model learns to reproduce the outputs (and sometimes the internal representations) of a larger \"teacher\" model or ensemble, so that much of the teacher's accuracy is kept at a fraction of its size and inference cost.",
